      "itemRevision": 1,
      "answer": {
        "status": "needs-review",
        "type": "single-choice",
        "optionId": "choice-a"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "status": "needs-review",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "markdown",
            "text": "factor of $(x+7.75)$意味着解为 $- 7.75$，a zero at $x=c$ 就是解为$c$，两个解的平均数就是顶点$x$\n坐标（二次函数图像对称性决定的），得到 $( - 7.75+c ) / 2=- 3.75$ 解得$c=0.25$\n（注意factor 和solution 可以相互计算及转换）"
          }
        ]
